1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,200
The last food pouch in my pack was empty.

2
00:00:03,250 --> 00:00:06,445
My third piece of modern gear. The food ran out.

3
00:00:06,495 --> 00:00:09,203
Bori looks at the stream and wags his tail.

4
00:00:09,253 --> 00:00:11,111
There are fish in the stream.

5
00:00:11,161 --> 00:00:13,752
I cut flexible willow branches,

6
00:00:13,802 --> 00:00:16,059
and weave them into a cone.

7
00:00:16,109 --> 00:00:19,087
Inside the mouth, I add one more funnel.

8
00:00:19,137 --> 00:00:21,637
Easy to get in, hard to get out.

9
00:00:21,687 --> 00:00:24,165
Bori sniffs it curiously.

10
00:00:24,215 --> 00:00:27,755
Mouth facing downstream, I pin it firmly with stones.

11
00:00:27,805 --> 00:00:29,261
And then, I wait.

12
00:00:29,311 --> 00:00:32,054
The next morning, the trap was heavy.

13
00:00:32,104 --> 00:00:33,554
Three fish.

14
00:00:33,604 --> 00:00:35,299
My first catch in this world.

15
00:00:35,349 --> 00:00:38,277
Now I find my own food too.
